jp:
{p}
あの悲劇を…
防ぐことが出来る…

{s}
同じことの繰り返しに
何の意味がある！？

en:
{s}
What is the point of repeating the
same thing!?

jp:
{p}
違う！ あの時は {s}が
誰と行くかを勝手に決めたんだ！

{s}
あなたのことを想って
したことなのに！ なのに！！

en:
{s}
That's cruel... Even without saying it, I
thought you understood how I felt...

jp:
{p}
ごめんよ {s}…
本当に ごめん…

en:
{p}
I'm sorry, {s}... I'm really
sorry...

jp:
{p}
本当に 悲劇を防げるの？
誰も苦しまず 悲しまないの？

en:
{p}
Can you really prevent the tragedy?
Will no one suffer or grieve?

{p}
I'm sorry, {s}...

In the end, I couldn't save you...

{p}
{s}... I'm scared... When I
think it might all repeat again...

jp:
{p}
だけど… 元の世界に戻れば…
また 君に逢えるはず！

en:
{p}
But... if I go back to our own world... I
should be able to see you again!

jp:
{p}
それが出来るのは…
魔王だけだ…

en:
{p}
The only one who could do that... is
the Demon King...

{p}
...All kinds of memories are getting
jumbled up... My head hurts...

{p}
Ah! Guard-san! Look at that!
Guard-san... I see, so it's true...!

jp:
{p}
イヤな予感がする…
この先には行かないほうがいいよ…

en:
{p}
I've got a bad feeling... We shouldn't
go any further...

{p}
Huh? Were these stairs here before?
Could this be... Dokuro's hideout...!?

{p}
Are you a Harenchi Gakuen
student too?

jp:
{p}
あ！
実は…

{p}
扉を開ける 鍵を探そう
きっとどこかに あるはずだ！

en:
{p}
Let's find the key to open the door. It
must be around here somewhere!
